{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这已经不是开玩笑了」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4273", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0879", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天早晨，又有一个纸箱子被放在了活动室门前。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "里面有着一只出生不过数月的小黑猫。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这已经是第二只被遗弃的猫了。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明白猫的饲主都还没有找到，现在又来一只。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "明明白猫的饲主都还没有找到，现在又来一只。", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "白猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咪——」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "wc0006", "char_id": "白猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "黑猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咪咪——」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "bc0000", "char_id": "黒猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两只小猫一唱一和地叫了起来。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么可以这么过分……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0975", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「猫猫好像很寂寞」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1255", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁无法原谅做出这种事情的人」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3394", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管怎样，必须得想办法做点什么才行呢。弃猫要是再这样增加下去就麻烦了」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": "「不管怎样，必须得想办法做点什么才行呢。弃猫要是再这样增加下去就麻烦了」", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4274", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0880", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐没事吧？」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，抱歉呢。明明我才是社团长……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0881", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐好像受了相当大的打击。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪及时地在身边握住了学姐的手。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正是这种时候，我们才必须成为学姐的助力。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「先去找万智老师商量一下吧。这不是我们几个人能解决的问题了」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "「先去找万智老师商量一下吧。这不是我们几个人能解决的问题了」", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是呢。我也觉得那样比较好」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4275", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐觉得这样可以吗？」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0882", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐？」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……嗯，是呢。还是去和八冢老师商量一下比较好」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": "「啊……嗯，是呢。还是去和八冢老师商量一下比较好」", "plain_idx": 280, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0883", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我实在不忍心看着学姐这副想不开的样子。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是再不想办法改善这种状况的话……", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……于是，我觉得应该来跟校长商量一下」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0268", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原来如此呢。这还真是不太妙……」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0559", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟万智老师说明情况之后，我们一起来找校长寻求帮助。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "跟万智老师说明情况之后，我们一起来找校长寻求帮助。", "plain_idx": 290, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「实在非常抱歉。因为我的原因，给大家造成了麻烦……」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "「实在非常抱歉。因为我的原因，给大家造成了麻烦……」", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0884", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才不是美羽学姐的错呢。都怪遗弃小猫的饲主不好！」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "「才不是美羽学姐的错呢。都怪遗弃小猫的饲主不好！」", "plain_idx": 293, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0976", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对啊。美羽同学不需要为此道歉……」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3395", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算如此，这样下去遗弃动物的人持续增加也是个大问题呢」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": "「就算如此，这样下去遗弃动物的人持续增加也是个大问题呢」", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0560", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那你叫我们怎么办啊」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4276", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们不就是为了想办法，才这样聚到一起的吗？」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0561", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「作为校长，总有点什么好办法的吧」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4277", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……总之有谁有什么好办法的话就赶快提出来吧，我会把万智嫁给他的」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "「嗯……总之有谁有什么好办法的话就赶快提出来吧，我会把万智嫁给他的」", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0562", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谁要那样的」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4278", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那样的……呜呜，也对。对濑名同学来说老师就是不需要的人呢」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "「那样的……呜呜，也对。对濑名同学来说老师就是不需要的人呢」", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0269", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，我不是这个意思……」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4279", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总的来说，就是没好主意的意思吧。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥，怎么办？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1256", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最坏的情况下，我们只得守夜来抓饲主。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "最坏的情况下，我们只得守夜来抓饲主。", "plain_idx": 317, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不能让人继续误解我们喵咪社的活动宗旨了。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "不能让人继续误解我们喵咪社的活动宗旨了。", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之目前能做的，就是在活动室门上张贴告示，让人们别再遗弃动物了吧」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": "「总之目前能做的，就是在活动室门上张贴告示，让人们别再遗弃动物了吧」", "plain_idx": 319, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，这是必须的」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0563", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我来负责做告示」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0977", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也来帮忙」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽说如此，这并不能从根源上解决问题。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是遗弃动物的事情还是没有解决的话……」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": "「要是遗弃动物的事情还是没有解决的话……」", "plain_idx": 326, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0564", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……没有的话会怎么样？」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4280", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0565", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长并没有继续说下去，而是将目光投向了美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "校长并没有继续说下去，而是将目光投向了美羽学姐。", "plain_idx": 331, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那绝非冰冷的目光。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我的个人意见是，还是交给社团长来判断好了」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": "「……我的个人意见是，还是交给社团长来判断好了」", "plain_idx": 333, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0566", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0885", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管如何，麻烦你对今后的状况要多加主意。还有，要是有什么事请务必向我报告。可以吗？」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": "「不管如何，麻烦你对今后的状况要多加主意。还有，要是有什么事请务必向我报告。可以吗？」", "plain_idx": 336, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0567", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么啊，有什么了不起的」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4281", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我是校长♪」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0568", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "母女吵架看起来一触即发的样子，这时候美羽学姐行了一礼，往门口走去。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": "母女吵架看起来一触即发的样子，这时候美羽学姐行了一礼，往门口走去。", "plain_idx": 342, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪紧随其后，我也跟了过去。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你们说想要保护动物」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0569", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但你们之后会遇到怎样的困难呢」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0570", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0886", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我只是自言自语而已，忘了吧」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0571", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜——」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0331", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "黑猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咪咪」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "bc0001", "char_id": "黒猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "白猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咪——」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "wc0007", "char_id": "白猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后的活动室。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知何时，两只小猫已经在纸箱里跟熊喵紧紧依偎在一起了。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": "不知何时，两只小猫已经在纸箱里跟熊喵紧紧依偎在一起了。", "plain_idx": 358, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "小猫们似乎已经完全把熊喵当成自己的母亲了。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": "小猫们似乎已经完全把熊喵当成自己的母亲了。", "plain_idx": 359, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0887", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那之后，美羽学姐一直无精打采。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在也是寂寞地蜷缩起身子，默默地看着纸箱中的小猫们。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": "现在也是寂寞地蜷缩起身子，默默地看着纸箱中的小猫们。", "plain_idx": 362, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我所做的事情，是错误的吗」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0888", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到美羽学姐的喃喃低语，我跟纱凪制作告示的手也不禁停了下来，看向对方。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": "听到美羽学姐的喃喃低语，我跟纱凪制作告示的手也不禁停了下来，看向对方。", "plain_idx": 365, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还是第一次看到学姐如此怯弱的样子。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算是以前废社危机的那会，也没听学姐说过什么泄气话……", "text_idx": 367, "plain": "就算是以前废社危机的那会，也没听学姐说过什么泄气话……", "plain_idx": 367, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐没有做错」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0978", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也这么觉得」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪说完，我紧接着对学姐说道。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如今我们能做的事情也仅限于此。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可是，要是我没有创建这个社团的话，小猫们也就不会被遗弃了……」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": "「可是，要是我没有创建这个社团的话，小猫们也就不会被遗弃了……」", "plain_idx": 373, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0889", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "黑猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咪——」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "bc0002", "char_id": "黒猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "白猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咪咪」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "wc0008", "char_id": "白猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听着小猫们的叫声，学姐紧紧地咬住了下唇。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，你把脸转到那边去」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0979", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪则是走到了学姐的身边，温柔地安慰学姐。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "背后传来了小小的抽泣声，我明白了我被要求转过身去的理由。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "背后传来了小小的抽泣声，我明白了我被要求转过身去的理由。", "plain_idx": 381, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "难道就没有什么办法能让学姐打起精神来吗？", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然小猫也很让人担心，不过我更担心的是美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "虽然小猫也很让人担心，不过我更担心的是美羽学姐。", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「各位慢走～♪」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3396", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我跟美羽学姐只是暂时回去而已」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0980", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等下就会回来吗？」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3397", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。虽然现在有小熊喵在照看，不过我还是放心不下小猫们……」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": "「嗯。虽然现在有小熊喵在照看，不过我还是放心不下小猫们……」", "plain_idx": 390, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0890", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样的话我也要回来」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「驳回。你家太远了」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0981", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太阳都快下山了，我可不能把学姐和纱凪丢在活动室里」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": "「太阳都快下山了，我可不能把学姐和纱凪丢在活动室里」", "plain_idx": 395, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太阳下山后还跟男人留在活动室才更加危险吧」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": "「太阳下山后还跟男人留在活动室才更加危险吧」", "plain_idx": 396, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0982", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我就这么不值得信任吗」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也不打算相信男人」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0983", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪用“快走快走”的手势赶着我。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种反应和以前大不相同了，我欣慰地微微一笑。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是这样的话，安洁有个提案」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": "「要是这样的话，安洁有个提案」", "plain_idx": 403, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3398", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好提案？」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。照顾小猫的事情，让安洁来做就可以了」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": "「是的。照顾小猫的事情，让安洁来做就可以了」", "plain_idx": 406, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3399", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，各位请好好让疲倦的身心休息一下吧」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": "「所以，各位请好好让疲倦的身心休息一下吧」", "plain_idx": 408, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3400", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那样可不行。明明平时已经那么麻烦菜菜了」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": "「那样可不行。明明平时已经那么麻烦菜菜了」", "plain_idx": 410, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0891", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽同学才太过操劳了」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3401", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁可是知道，美羽同学会在深夜悄悄潜入活动室的哦」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": "「安洁可是知道，美羽同学会在深夜悄悄潜入活动室的哦」", "plain_idx": 414, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3402", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？深夜悄悄潜入活动室……」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……只是偶尔而已。有时候担心动物们是否还好……」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": "「啊……只是偶尔而已。有时候担心动物们是否还好……」", "plain_idx": 417, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0892", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且，纱纱也是」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3403", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我怎么着都无所谓吧」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0984", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还真比不上这两人啊。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连社团活动都结束了还能往活动室跑……", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不过，这才会有那份牵绊吧。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这两个人真的很厉害。", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天起就是快乐三连休了。美羽同学和纱纱也请好好休息吧」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": "「明天起就是快乐三连休了。美羽同学和纱纱也请好好休息吧」", "plain_idx": 427, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3404", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁也在为美羽学姐担心。", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是有安洁来帮忙照顾小猫们的话，也可以暂时安心了吧。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": "要是有安洁来帮忙照顾小猫们的话，也可以暂时安心了吧。", "plain_idx": 430, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "既然如此……", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐，明天我们去哪里换下心情吧？」", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶……？」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0893", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果出去买些东西，说不定会让心情放松一下」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": "「如果出去买些东西，说不定会让心情放松一下」", "plain_idx": 435, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然我理解学姐担心小猫的心情，但一直紧绷着神经不是什么好事」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": "「虽然我理解学姐担心小猫的心情，但一直紧绷着神经不是什么好事」", "plain_idx": 436, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼哼，新吾挺能干的嘛」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0985", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以明天请跟我一起……」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不对，等下等下等下——！」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0986", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这家伙想趁乱说什么？那不就成约会了吗」", "text_idx": 442, "plain": "「你这家伙想趁乱说什么？那不就成约会了吗」", "plain_idx": 442, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0987", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，我没那个意思……」", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「骗子。你的企图早就暴露无遗了」", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0988", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐，请尽管放心。我会从这个男人的毒牙中守护你的」", "text_idx": 447, "plain": "「美羽学姐，请尽管放心。我会从这个男人的毒牙中守护你的」", "plain_idx": 447, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0989", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「守护……」", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也一起去。怎么可能让你跟美羽学姐两个人独处！」", "text_idx": 450, "plain": "「我也一起去。怎么可能让你跟美羽学姐两个人独处！」", "plain_idx": 450, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0990", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「事情变成这样了，学姐意下如何？」", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，嗯。我觉得……」", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0894", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「答案是YES！安洁对美羽同学，纱纱和新吾同学之间的三角关系期待得不得了」", "text_idx": 455, "plain": "「答案是YES！安洁对美羽同学，纱纱和新吾同学之间的三角关系期待得不得了」", "plain_idx": 455, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3405", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「事情不会发展成安洁你期待的那样的」", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那么，我就不辜负大家的一片好意了」", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0895", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「决定了呢。新吾同学加油」", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3406", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你只是个拿东西的，别太得意忘形了」", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0991", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「知道了——」", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0896", "char_id": "みう"}]}
